# Angular

- Standalone components/directives/pipes; `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`.
- Prefer `input()` / `output()` / `model()` and `inject()`.
- Templates: `@if` / `@for` / `@switch` (not `*ngIf` / `*ngFor`).
- No `any`, no non-null assertions in production code; `eqeqeq` always.
- Use `provideDesignSystem()`, `provideAppConfig(environment)` in app composition roots.
- Prefer Signals for local UI; bridge RxJS with `toSignal` at edges.
- Follow Nx tags / `@nx/enforce-module-boundaries`.
- Never put `interface` / `type` / models / lookup maps / nav constants inside `*.component.ts` — use sibling `*.model.ts` / `*.types.ts` / `*.defs.ts`.
- Full AI rules: see root `AGENTS.md`.
